    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are delighted to present to the market 8 Walkinstown Drive. A wonderful opportunity to acquire a 3 bedroom family home, extended to the rear with off street parking, garage and c. 65’ long garden which is not overlooked which offers tremendous scope to extend to rear and side (subject to p.p). A successful project undertaken by a number of neighbours. Ideally positioned on this quiet road between Walkinstown Road and Walkinstown Avenue with a wealth of amenities on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nWonderfully proportioned and light filled accommodation briefly comprising of entrance porch, entrance hallway with guest w.c off. The living room is to the front with gas fire and pine mantlepiece. To the rear is the lounge with marble mantlepiece. Beyond the hallway is the extended kitchen/dining room with large sliding doors providing access to the rear garden. The kitchen itself comes with a range of kitchen unts, plumbed for washing machine, sink unit and tiled floor throughout. Off the dining is a covered area, side access, door to garden and access to the garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs is equally as spacious with three fined sized bedrooms, bedroom 1 is to the front with built in wardrobes. Bedroom 2 is to the rear also with built in wardrobes and vanity area and bedroom 3 is to the front. The family bathroom completes the internal accommodation complete with bath, separate shower, w.c, whb, tiled floor and tiled walls.\r\n\r\nOutside to the front is off street parking and access to the garage with lawn. To the rear is a wonderful c. 65’ long garden laid out in lawn with paved patio areas and bordered by mature hedging and planting.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none, conveniently located in the heart of Walkinstown with a host of amenities on the doorstep. The property is within walking distance of a selection of shops including those at Supervalu and Ashleaf Shopping centres, Lidl, Aldi. There are a great local shops, cafes and restaurants including The Green Kitchen, Deanos Pizza, Cluck Chicken and Camille to name a few.\r\n\r\nThe property is close to an excellent choice of primary and secondary schools, green open spaces and parks with Walkinstown Park on your doorstep. There are no shortage of local transport links in the area with numerous bus routes, Kylemore Luas station is just over 10 minutes walk away and provides easy access direct to the city centre. There is easy access to Naas Road, M50 and national road network."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch\r\n\r\nEntrance hallway\r\nLaminate floor and understairs storage.\r\n\r\nGuest w.c,\r\nTiled floor, w.c, whb\r\n\r\nLiving\r\nPine mantlepiece, large window overlooking garden to front.\r\n\r\nLounge\r\nMarble fireplace, large window overlooking garden to rear\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining\r\nTiled floor throughout, door to covered area and sliding door to garden. Kitchen with a range of units, sink unit, extractor fan, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nBedroom 1 (Front)\r\nBuilt in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Rear)\r\nBuilt in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (Front)\r\nBuilt in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nFully tiled with bath, shower, w.c, whb and radiator.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nOff street parking to the front with lawn and access to the garage.\r\nWonderful rear garden benefitting from sunshine throughout the entire day with paved patio area, lawn and an abundance of planting, shrubs and trees. The garden offers a high degree of privacy and is not overlooked."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Off street parking\r\nGFCH\r\nDouble glazed\r\nSide access\r\nc. 85’ long rear garden which is not overlooked\r\nSpacious proportions\r\nQuiet location\r\nRoom to extend (subject to p.p)\r\nGarage\r\nMature location\r\nNumerous bus routes and LUAS within walking distance\r\nBeside variety of shops, cafes and restaurants\r\nConvenient to the M50 and National Road Network"
      },
